"phrase\">make a breakthrough</span><br><span class=\"meaning\">取得重大突破/进展</span></div>\n    <div class=\"entry\"><span class=\"phrase\">make a change</span> <span class=\"meaning\">做出改变</span></div>\n    <div class=\"entry\"><span class=\"phrase\">make a choice</span> <span class=\"meaning\">做出选择</span></div>\n    <div class=\"entry\"><span class=\"phrase\">make a conclusion</span> <span class=\"meaning\">下结论</span></div>\n    <div class=\"entry\"><span class=\"phrase\">make a deal</span> <span class=\"meaning\">达成协议</span></div>\n    <div class=\"entry\"><span class=\"phrase\">make a decision</span> <span class=\"meaning\">做决定</span></div>\n    <div class=\"entry\"><span class=\"phrase\">make a difference</span><br><span class=\"meaning\">起(重要)作用；区别对待</span></div>\n    <div class=\"entry\"><span class=\"phrase\">make a fool of sb</span> <span class=\"meaning\">愚弄某人</span></div>\n    <div class=\"entry\"><span class=\"phrase\">make a fortune</span> <span class=\"meaning\">发财，赚钱</span></div>\n    <div class=\"entry\"><span class=\"phrase\">make a full recovery</span><br><span class=\"meaning\">完全康复</span></div>\n    <div class=\"entry\"><span class=\"phrase\">make a living</span> <span class=\"meaning\">谋生</span></div>\n    <div class=\"entry\"><span class=\"phrase\">make a promise</span> <span class=\"meaning\">许下诺言</span></div>\n    <div class=\"entry\"><span class=\"phrase\">make a remark</span> <span class=\"meaning\">评论</span></div>\n    <div class=\"entry\"><span class=\"phrase\">make a request</span> <span class=\"meaning\">提出请求</span></div>\n    <div class=\"entry\"><span class=\"phrase\">make an apology to sb</span><br><span class=\"meaning\">向某人道歉</span></div>\n    <div class=\"entry\"><span class=\"phrase\">make an appointment with</span><br><span class=\"meaning\">与...约会/预约</span></div>\n    <div class=\"entry\"><span class=\"phrase\">make an effort/efforts</span><br><span class=\"meaning\">尽力</span></div>\n\n    <div class=\"section-header\">make 短语(2)</